      showPersistenceNotice: m['showPersistenceNotice'] as bool,
      version: m['version'] as String,
    );
  }

  /// State is "ok", "fresh" (a new collection was created) or "corrupt"
  /// (stored data could not be read; it was left untouched).
  final String state;

